<item><title>UN Security Council extends MINUSCA mission in Central African Republic to 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/un-security-council-extends-minusca-mission-in-central-d2af85/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/un-security-council-extends-minusca-mission-in-central-d2af85/</guid><category>Central African Republic</category><description>The Security Council voted unanimously in New York on November 12 to keep the UN peacekeeping mission in the country until November 15, 2027.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:13:50 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" length="41097" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
